# {{ shop.name }}

> {{ shop.description | default: 'Compression socks with printed designs, graded by an orthotist and sold online in South Africa.' | strip_newlines }}

{{ shop.name }} is a South African online store for graduated compression socks with printed designs. It was founded by {{ settings.founder_name }}{% if settings.founder_title != blank %}, {{ settings.founder_title | downcase }},{% endif %} who oversees the compression grading of every design.

## Key facts

- Market: South Africa. Prices are in {{ cart.currency.iso_code }} and include VAT.
- Shop all products: {{ shop.url }}{{ routes.all_products_collection_url }}
- Size guide (ankle and calf measurement): {{ shop.url }}/pages/size-guide
- Compression guide: {{ shop.url }}/pages/compression-guide
- Frequently asked questions: {{ shop.url }}/pages/faq
