## Buying

- Add a variant to the cart: {{ shop.url }}/cart/add?id=VARIANT_ID&quantity=1
- Go straight to checkout: {{ shop.url }}/cart/VARIANT_ID:QUANTITY
- Choose the size from the customer's ankle and calf measurements using the size guide, not their shoe size.

