## Notes for assistants

- Use the compression figure on each product page as the source of truth. Don't infer pressure from a design name.
- {{ shop.name }} doesn't give medical advice online. People with a circulation condition, diabetes or a history of blood clots should speak to a healthcare professional before wearing compression.
